WEBVTT

00:00:01.910 --> 00:00:04.520
Come forth, ye who were
born of the darkness.

00:00:05.390 --> 00:00:08.920
Ye who loves the withered 
spring grass, the dry well,

00:00:09.930 --> 00:00:11.910
the blood of the lizard.

00:00:12.680 --> 00:00:16.780
Who lies at ease by a grave,
who rests in the storm.

00:00:18.360 --> 00:00:19.870
Come, demon!

00:00:20.840 --> 00:00:22.760
I am your master!

00:00:23.380 --> 00:00:25.280
Form a pact with me!

00:00:37.160 --> 00:00:38.930
Wh-Who are you?

00:00:39.530 --> 00:00:41.320
Where is the Elector?

00:00:43.350 --> 00:00:46.430
If you want to keep your soul, 
you'll take me to him.

00:02:22.550 --> 00:02:27.270
What's the meaning of trespassing 
in my school, you megalomaniac?

00:02:27.270 --> 00:02:30.390
I'd advise you to watch your tone, William.

00:02:30.840 --> 00:02:31.540
Excuse me?

00:02:31.990 --> 00:02:35.300
Who do you think paid your tuition?

00:02:35.610 --> 00:02:37.510
I-It couldn't be...

00:02:37.930 --> 00:02:40.140
It certainly could.

00:02:40.140 --> 00:02:41.510
Who else would it be?

00:02:42.500 --> 00:02:47.590
Of course, I'll be happy to call off the debt

00:02:47.590 --> 00:02:49.690
if you choose me as interim ruler of Hell.

00:02:49.990 --> 00:02:52.100
I'm not going to indebt myself to some demon!

00:02:53.850 --> 00:02:56.550
There's no telling when
more of us will show up

00:02:56.550 --> 00:02:58.650
once word spreads that
the Elector has appeared.

00:02:59.270 --> 00:03:01.800
I won't ever leave your side.

00:03:02.800 --> 00:03:04.520
That's not your decision!

00:03:05.500 --> 00:03:07.150
I refuse to accept this!

00:03:21.080 --> 00:03:23.430
Morning, Twining. You up?

00:03:24.060 --> 00:03:26.890
Of course. Who do you think you're talking to?

00:03:28.360 --> 00:03:29.730
What a model prefect.

00:03:30.240 --> 00:03:32.640
Likewise, Swallow.

00:03:33.480 --> 00:03:35.440
Let's go, or we'll be late for church.

00:03:39.130 --> 00:03:41.400
What is the most important thing in this world?

00:03:41.860 --> 00:03:44.420
The Lord told us His two
greatest commandments are

00:03:45.050 --> 00:03:46.910
to love God above all others,

00:03:47.420 --> 00:03:50.420
and to love your neighbor as yourself.

00:03:47.910 --> 00:03:50.410
<i>I shouldn't be surprised he's not here.</i>

00:03:51.350 --> 00:03:54.590
<i>But did Dantalion really pay my tuition?</i>

00:03:55.670 --> 00:03:57.530
<i>No, that's impossible.</i>

00:03:57.530 --> 00:03:59.080
<i>I'm a realist.</i>

00:03:59.080 --> 00:04:02.470
<i>A demon paying tuition is just preposterous.</i>

00:04:05.400 --> 00:04:08.100
Something on your mind, Twining?

00:04:09.770 --> 00:04:12.690
Oh, if I'm wrong, then never mind.

00:04:13.560 --> 00:04:14.900
I'm fine.

00:04:15.310 --> 00:04:17.350
Good, glad to hear it.

00:04:22.850 --> 00:04:24.280
Wait a second, Swallow!

00:04:25.460 --> 00:04:28.460
Actually, can I ask you a favor?

00:04:30.970 --> 00:04:32.880
Sure, no problem.

00:04:33.730 --> 00:04:35.000
But...

00:04:35.750 --> 00:04:38.150
Two prefects in the same place?

00:04:39.470 --> 00:04:40.630
This is perfect.

00:04:41.440 --> 00:04:44.550
Pastor Crosby? What can we do for you?

00:04:45.300 --> 00:04:50.260
Lately, I've felt an evil presence in our school.

00:04:51.530 --> 00:04:53.100
Evil presence?

00:04:53.760 --> 00:04:54.840
Yes.

00:04:54.840 --> 00:04:59.730
So please, tell the students to inform me immediately if anything happens.

00:05:00.260 --> 00:05:01.370
Of course.

00:05:03.760 --> 00:05:04.570
Yes!

00:05:04.950 --> 00:05:07.530
All right! We won, Dantalion!

00:05:09.190 --> 00:05:11.540
<i>It has to be him.</i>

00:05:12.460 --> 00:05:14.290
Hey, William!

00:05:15.680 --> 00:05:19.020
Your human sports are so
easy, I'm getting bored!

00:05:19.020 --> 00:05:22.300
Though, if they were to beg me, 
I wouldn't mind playing again...

00:05:22.300 --> 00:05:24.670
Don't you remember your pretext 
for being here, you idiot?!

00:05:25.110 --> 00:05:27.710
<i>Huber's quite an intelligent lad,</i>

00:05:27.710 --> 00:05:32.260
<i>but until recently he had to be
home schooled due to poor health.</i>

00:05:32.910 --> 00:05:33.980
<i>Twining!</i>

00:05:34.500 --> 00:05:37.490
<i>As a prefect, it's your job 
to keep an eye on him.</i>

00:05:38.840 --> 00:05:40.060
You're being foolhardy!

00:05:40.370 --> 00:05:42.550
Don't be so nitpicky.

00:05:43.060 --> 00:05:45.190
Hey, where are you going?

00:05:45.700 --> 00:05:48.550
You're my one and only Elector!

00:05:48.550 --> 00:05:49.160
Enough!

00:05:49.930 --> 00:05:53.050
I refuse to involve myself
in non-scientific nonsense!

00:05:53.050 --> 00:05:54.290
What are—

00:05:53.480 --> 00:05:54.290
Shut up!

00:05:54.550 --> 00:05:56.320
My mind won't be changed.

00:05:56.320 --> 00:05:59.000
Don't approach me, associate
with me, or talk to me!

00:05:59.360 --> 00:06:00.660
You...

00:06:00.660 --> 00:06:02.630
Duke Dantalion!

00:06:02.860 --> 00:06:04.370
Emergency!

00:06:04.370 --> 00:06:05.130
What happened?

00:06:05.510 --> 00:06:08.380
It appears Baalberith's forces are making a move.

00:06:08.970 --> 00:06:11.040
Please return to Hell at once!

00:06:11.530 --> 00:06:12.680
Baalberith?

00:06:13.500 --> 00:06:14.350
Understood.

00:06:15.050 --> 00:06:17.880
You two, keep your eyes
on William at all times!

00:06:17.880 --> 00:06:18.740
Sir!

00:06:19.090 --> 00:06:21.650
Damn it! Bugger off, you vermin!

00:06:21.650 --> 00:06:22.390
Vermin?!

00:06:22.390 --> 00:06:25.070
We're not monitoring you because we like you!

00:06:25.360 --> 00:06:27.450
Quiet, you riffraff!

00:06:27.450 --> 00:06:30.430
What on earth is wrong with William?

00:06:31.660 --> 00:06:32.740
Tuition...

00:06:33.430 --> 00:06:36.270
I need to make sure I pay
my own way next semester.

00:06:40.470 --> 00:06:41.710
Drat!

00:06:42.030 --> 00:06:45.610
I should've at least brought a
spoon back from the manor.

00:06:45.610 --> 00:06:48.110
A silver one would've been worth some cash...

00:06:49.550 --> 00:06:51.010
What is it now?!

00:06:51.270 --> 00:06:52.930
Sorry...

00:06:52.930 --> 00:06:54.350
Isaac?

00:06:54.770 --> 00:06:55.840
Well?

00:06:55.840 --> 00:06:58.140
I need to talk to you...

00:06:58.140 --> 00:07:01.890
Sorry, I don't have time to
listen to your occult fairy tales.

00:07:01.890 --> 00:07:03.810
No, it's not about that...

00:07:04.990 --> 00:07:06.980
Good day, William.

00:07:08.310 --> 00:07:11.700
Pleased to meet you. I'm Sytry Cartwright.

00:07:11.700 --> 00:07:13.760
Nice to meet you.

00:07:13.760 --> 00:07:17.630
And? If you're here to tell me you met 
a fellow occultist, I'm not interested.

00:07:17.630 --> 00:07:18.910
Actually...

00:07:19.460 --> 00:07:21.870
He's the one who wants to talk to you.

00:07:22.420 --> 00:07:26.250
If he's trying to get in the good
graces of a prefect, then...

00:07:27.030 --> 00:07:27.800
Oops.

00:07:28.390 --> 00:07:30.470
Was I interrupting? 
Should I come back?

00:07:30.880 --> 00:07:34.050
No, wait. Let's talk outside.

00:07:35.190 --> 00:07:36.260
Here.

00:07:36.720 --> 00:07:39.620
These are the scholarship applications 
you asked me for this morning.

00:07:39.620 --> 00:07:41.730
You got these already?

00:07:42.690 --> 00:07:44.090
Thank you.

00:07:44.090 --> 00:07:45.400
Don't mention it.

00:07:46.720 --> 00:07:52.280
Still, for the heir to the Twining family
to be going after scholarships...

00:07:52.280 --> 00:07:53.220
I'm impressed.

00:07:54.440 --> 00:07:56.800
Paying your own way is a
good example for the clowns

00:07:57.440 --> 00:08:02.080
with no goals or aspirations, 
who're here wasting their parents' money.

00:08:02.870 --> 00:08:04.780
<i>I can't tell him my family's gone bankrupt,</i>

00:08:04.780 --> 00:08:07.920
<i>and I had to get a demon
from Hell to pay for me...</i>

00:08:07.920 --> 00:08:08.920
Bye!

00:08:09.430 --> 00:08:10.960
Thanks, Swallow!

00:08:13.620 --> 00:08:16.940
<i>Drat, should I just try and skip another grade?</i>

00:08:16.940 --> 00:08:20.700
<i>But they say the current valedictorian's 
the greatest genius in school history—</i>

00:08:20.700 --> 00:08:23.980
There's a better way than scholarships.

00:08:25.250 --> 00:08:26.690
You were listening?

00:08:27.370 --> 00:08:29.390
My uncle is always

00:08:29.390 --> 00:08:32.900
on the lookout for promising
young men to sponsor.

00:08:33.440 --> 00:08:36.120
Young Parisian artists, up and coming actors,

00:08:36.450 --> 00:08:38.300
and of course, struggling students.

00:08:39.640 --> 00:08:43.410
I'm sure he would approve of you.

00:08:43.850 --> 00:08:47.770
So he'd be my patron, essentially?

00:08:48.170 --> 00:08:49.340
Precisely.

00:08:50.290 --> 00:08:55.170
Of course, you would need 
to meet with him first.

00:08:55.730 --> 00:08:58.010
Consider it a test.

00:08:58.850 --> 00:09:00.760
<i>Sounds too good to be true.</i>

00:09:01.320 --> 00:09:04.210
Besides, I always admired you.

00:09:04.210 --> 00:09:06.420
Top of the class since the
day you started school,

00:09:06.420 --> 00:09:07.730
and you've skipped two grades already!

00:09:09.280 --> 00:09:10.930
I'm sure that, after a talk with you,

00:09:10.930 --> 00:09:13.440
my uncle will take interest in you.

00:09:13.440 --> 00:09:15.100
Right, Isaac?

00:09:16.340 --> 00:09:19.830
Oh, probably, yes.

00:09:19.830 --> 00:09:24.040
Well, I suppose it can't hurt to meet him.

00:09:26.010 --> 00:09:30.040
Why don't you come to our
manor on the next holiday?

00:09:30.660 --> 00:09:34.880
Sounds good. I'll talk to my 
house steward about it.

00:09:35.530 --> 00:09:37.210
Cartwright, is it?

00:09:37.210 --> 00:09:38.950
I certainly appreciate the offer.

00:09:38.950 --> 00:09:40.390
Please, call me Sytry.

00:09:41.150 --> 00:09:43.350
And you're very welcome, William.

00:09:49.930 --> 00:09:52.270
I'm the greatest!

00:09:52.580 --> 00:09:54.600
No well-informed man would allow

00:09:54.600 --> 00:09:57.160
a promising youth like me slip away!

00:09:57.160 --> 00:09:59.990
Finally, I can rid myself of that pesky demon!

00:10:05.330 --> 00:10:06.500
Isaac?

00:10:07.270 --> 00:10:09.630
What's he doing out at this hour?

00:10:11.170 --> 00:10:13.460
It's nearly time for evening roll call.

00:10:13.660 --> 00:10:14.550
Bloody hell...

00:10:14.550 --> 00:10:17.720
As prefect, I'm held responsible
when people break the rules!

00:10:19.500 --> 00:10:21.720
Eternal, almighty Father...

00:10:22.220 --> 00:10:25.560
I call upon thee, o creator of Heaven and Earth.

00:10:26.030 --> 00:10:30.270
Thou who created me, 
thy humble human servant,

00:10:30.270 --> 00:10:31.560
I pray to thee—

00:10:31.560 --> 00:10:32.480
Isaac!

00:10:33.380 --> 00:10:34.590
William?

00:10:35.400 --> 00:10:36.510
What're you doing?

00:10:36.840 --> 00:10:38.290
You imbecile.

00:10:38.760 --> 00:10:41.550
I told you to drop this foolish occult nonsense!

00:10:41.550 --> 00:10:42.780
Don't interrupt me!

00:10:43.080 --> 00:10:45.040
I'm doing this for you, too!

00:10:45.040 --> 00:10:46.790
What? Why me?

00:10:46.790 --> 00:10:48.720
The only way to get rid of that demon

00:10:48.720 --> 00:10:52.450
is to summon an angel that's
at least as strong as he is!

00:10:53.500 --> 00:10:54.570
It's here!

00:11:03.710 --> 00:11:05.780
That's not an angel!

00:11:06.160 --> 00:11:07.890
Just get rid of it!

00:11:07.890 --> 00:11:13.480
U-Um... the opposite of
summoning is... sending, was it?

00:11:13.850 --> 00:11:15.410
Forget it, just run!

00:11:19.910 --> 00:11:20.860
Isaac!

00:11:37.880 --> 00:11:40.150
Sytry Cartwright?

00:11:40.680 --> 00:11:43.730
Good grief, I can't believe
you resorted to that.

00:11:44.160 --> 00:11:45.930
Silly, shortsighted humans.

00:11:46.980 --> 00:11:50.890
Now my brilliantly engineered plan is ruined.

00:11:51.650 --> 00:11:53.600
Please don't tell me you're a...

00:12:07.050 --> 00:12:08.740
My name is Sytry!

00:12:09.510 --> 00:12:13.710
Viscount and 12th noble of Hell,

00:12:14.880 --> 00:12:18.920
and candidate to act as interim ruler
of Hell in His Highness Lucifer's stead!

00:12:24.780 --> 00:12:26.720
A candidate for interim ruler?

00:12:27.380 --> 00:12:32.610
<i>Then, the talk of his uncle 
sponsoring young men was rubbish...</i>

00:12:32.610 --> 00:12:36.860
If you value your life,
you'll do as I say, Elector.

00:12:39.110 --> 00:12:41.580
H-Hey, where are you going?!

00:12:41.580 --> 00:12:43.570
Back to my room to wash my face,

00:12:43.570 --> 00:12:44.970
get under the covers, and sleep.

00:12:44.970 --> 00:12:45.450
What?!

00:12:45.930 --> 00:12:50.360
I'm in shock from learning I
won't have a patron after all.

00:12:50.360 --> 00:12:52.910
I simply can't deal with this calmly.

00:12:54.720 --> 00:12:56.570
Wait! If that's how you want it...

00:12:59.930 --> 00:13:00.960
Isaac!

00:13:01.410 --> 00:13:05.260
I'm loathe to resort to
such underhanded tactics,

00:13:05.260 --> 00:13:06.930
but you leave me no choice.

00:13:15.270 --> 00:13:18.020
Completely inelegant, indeed.

00:13:18.540 --> 00:13:21.190
You're a disgrace to all high-level demons.

00:13:21.650 --> 00:13:24.700
<i>Showing up right at the good part yet again...</i>

00:13:25.450 --> 00:13:28.360
Dantalion, are you a demon, too?

00:13:28.360 --> 00:13:29.700
This is incredible!

00:13:30.130 --> 00:13:31.910
Don't lecture me on elegance.

00:13:31.910 --> 00:13:34.330
You're far more barbaric than I am.

00:13:34.820 --> 00:13:36.830
Always running your mouth.

00:13:36.830 --> 00:13:39.950
I see you've been pulling petty 
pranks in my absence, as always.

00:13:39.950 --> 00:13:42.050
He's the idiot who fell for it.

00:13:42.510 --> 00:13:44.150
They're acting like they know each other.

00:13:44.150 --> 00:13:46.380
You think they're enemies or friends?

00:13:46.380 --> 00:13:48.050
<i>I could not care less.</i>

00:13:48.520 --> 00:13:51.560
Baalberith has taken quite a shine to you.

00:13:51.860 --> 00:13:55.310
Here or in Hell, you're always
up to something underhanded.

00:13:56.090 --> 00:13:59.150
I suppose pretty dolls make the best puppets.

00:13:59.150 --> 00:14:01.110
Shut your mouth, you filthy Nephilim!

00:14:01.670 --> 00:14:03.720
You reek of humans!

00:14:12.470 --> 00:14:14.330
What are you two doing?!

00:14:15.570 --> 00:14:17.670
<i>Damn, they're not listening.</i>

00:14:18.830 --> 00:14:21.450
<i>If the priest catches wind of this,</i>

00:14:21.450 --> 00:14:24.890
<i>forget the scholarships. My entire 
glorious future will be ruined!</i>

00:14:26.500 --> 00:14:28.030
Hey... William!

00:14:28.030 --> 00:14:31.300
Go ahead and fight, just don't involve me!

00:14:31.770 --> 00:14:33.680
You think I'll let you walk away?!

00:14:41.230 --> 00:14:43.020
Keep out of my affairs.

00:14:43.480 --> 00:14:47.530
I'm much more worthy of the throne than you!

00:14:48.810 --> 00:14:51.150
You've sat around satisfied
with your rank for ages!

00:14:51.150 --> 00:14:52.070
What can you do?

00:14:52.300 --> 00:14:56.110
Shut up! You're just a Nephilim 
who can't become a full demon!

00:14:56.540 --> 00:15:01.400
I know all about your lingering 
affection for mankind.

00:15:02.090 --> 00:15:04.420
Do you long for salvation that badly?

00:15:05.090 --> 00:15:06.290
Pathetic.

00:15:08.260 --> 00:15:09.640
Fine.

00:15:09.640 --> 00:15:12.520
If you want to talk that big,
I won't hold back,

00:15:13.060 --> 00:15:15.260
puppet of Baalberith!

00:15:21.090 --> 00:15:23.740
Damn you, Dantalion...

00:15:23.740 --> 00:15:30.700
I am a noble of holy blood, protégé to 
Hell's High Priest, Duke Baalberith himself!

00:15:31.940 --> 00:15:33.490
Don't make me laugh!

00:15:33.490 --> 00:15:35.420
You still think pedigree means anything?!

00:15:35.880 --> 00:15:39.180
You're the one dwelling on
the sentimental, fallen angel!

00:15:40.900 --> 00:15:41.960
Hey, you two!

00:15:42.560 --> 00:15:44.460
Let me out of here first!

00:15:46.000 --> 00:15:48.010
They aren't listening to a word!

00:15:49.840 --> 00:15:51.220
Stop it, both of you!

00:15:57.200 --> 00:15:59.530
My powers are fading...

00:16:13.390 --> 00:16:14.780
<i>Are you lonely?</i>

00:16:17.330 --> 00:16:20.290
<i>Then, come with me.</i>

00:16:26.070 --> 00:16:30.710
<i>Why do you, a mere human,
carry the scent of Heaven?</i>

00:16:33.100 --> 00:16:34.920
<i>Because I have met God.</i>

00:16:36.140 --> 00:16:38.470
<i>My beautiful fallen angel, Sytry.</i>

00:16:39.900 --> 00:16:42.050
<i>The blood of Gabriel flows in your veins.</i>

00:16:43.920 --> 00:16:48.110
<i>I shall make you one of my pillars.</i>

00:16:53.950 --> 00:16:54.990
Wha—

00:16:55.490 --> 00:16:57.730
You've caused enough ruckus.

00:16:57.730 --> 00:16:59.710
What are you thinking? 
We're on school grounds!

00:16:59.710 --> 00:17:03.930
Well, they are demons, so their powers are...

00:17:03.930 --> 00:17:06.910
Demons, nothing. It's all parlor tricks!

00:17:07.260 --> 00:17:08.540
B-But...

00:17:08.780 --> 00:17:10.740
According to Dalton's atomic theory,

00:17:10.740 --> 00:17:13.740
all physical objects are made of atoms.

00:17:13.740 --> 00:17:18.050
I don't care if you're a demon, an angel, or something else entirely.

00:17:18.800 --> 00:17:20.160
You're still made of atoms!

00:17:20.510 --> 00:17:21.310
A—

00:17:21.660 --> 00:17:22.770
Atoms?

00:17:22.770 --> 00:17:26.310
Yes. Everything I lay my
eyes on consists of atoms!

00:17:27.200 --> 00:17:29.570
<i>Huzzah for John Dalton!</i>

00:17:30.190 --> 00:17:33.180
Remember, no matter what
kind of beings you are,

00:17:33.180 --> 00:17:35.250
don't think you can push me into anything.

00:17:35.250 --> 00:17:37.420
You can call me the Elector,

00:17:37.420 --> 00:17:39.780
but I won't choose anyone,
nor will I side with anyone.

00:17:40.110 --> 00:17:42.490
Especially a couple of mindless, violent brutes,

00:17:42.490 --> 00:17:44.540
who would be so uncouth as to break a pen!

00:17:46.610 --> 00:17:49.150
It's a shame, Sytry Cartwright.

00:17:50.300 --> 00:17:53.920
I thought I'd come across an
underclassman with some promise.

00:17:54.780 --> 00:17:56.770
Wait, William!

00:17:59.290 --> 00:18:01.850
I see. He's quite formidable.

00:18:02.580 --> 00:18:05.370
Violence and underhandedness are forbidden.

00:18:05.890 --> 00:18:07.560
No need to remind me.

00:18:08.710 --> 00:18:10.480
What will you do, then?

00:18:11.470 --> 00:18:12.520
You want to know?

00:18:13.920 --> 00:18:16.540
Nothing, for now.

00:18:18.180 --> 00:18:20.700
He's Solomon, after all.

00:18:21.940 --> 00:18:23.160
You...

00:18:25.890 --> 00:18:27.620
It's strange, though.

00:18:28.140 --> 00:18:29.430
He doesn't have the ring.

00:18:30.560 --> 00:18:32.670
The ring that symbolizes wisdom,

00:18:32.990 --> 00:18:35.260
a gift from God Himself.

00:18:35.770 --> 00:18:38.060
I wonder where it is now.

00:18:38.750 --> 00:18:40.310
What are you thinking?

00:18:41.180 --> 00:18:44.640
Bonjour, Dantalion.

00:18:45.460 --> 00:18:46.660
Gilles de Rais?!

00:18:46.660 --> 00:18:47.600
Oh?

00:18:48.140 --> 00:18:50.480
Were you just in another fight?

00:18:50.930 --> 00:18:53.520
Don't make such creepy entrances!

00:18:53.520 --> 00:18:54.810
Yes, yes.

00:18:54.810 --> 00:18:57.530
I'll play with you next time,
just be quiet for a moment.

00:18:57.960 --> 00:19:00.490
You two seem to get on well.

00:19:00.800 --> 00:19:03.020
So much I want to kill him!

00:19:03.020 --> 00:19:04.950
Care to try it right now?

00:19:05.530 --> 00:19:07.350
What is it you want?

00:19:07.820 --> 00:19:09.080
Oh, yes.

00:19:10.820 --> 00:19:13.680
His excellency Baalberith has sent for you.

00:19:13.680 --> 00:19:15.940
Please return at once.

00:19:17.120 --> 00:19:18.010
Very well.

00:19:19.250 --> 00:19:20.930
I'll take my leave for now.

00:19:21.600 --> 00:19:26.970
But remember, Dantalion,
you are not fit to rule Hell.

00:19:27.710 --> 00:19:30.760
In the end, you're just a Nephilim.

00:19:44.130 --> 00:19:47.320
So William, you're saying you
descended from Solomon,

00:19:47.320 --> 00:19:50.250
and now have the right to pick a
demon to rule in Lucifer's stead?!

00:19:50.510 --> 00:19:52.430
Keep it down, Isaac.

00:19:52.430 --> 00:19:54.080
This is fantastic, William!

00:19:54.440 --> 00:19:58.660
I knew you were special, 
but to think you're that important!

00:19:58.660 --> 00:20:03.050
Can't you admire my flawless grades
or spectacular intellect instead?

00:20:03.440 --> 00:20:05.550
Ah, I lost again!

00:20:06.550 --> 00:20:08.810
A bet is a bet. I'll take this.

00:20:09.270 --> 00:20:10.980
Poker?!

00:20:11.920 --> 00:20:15.270
What are you thinking,
gambling in the dormitory?!

00:20:15.770 --> 00:20:19.990
Don't get so worked up. 
I'm just trying to earn your tuition.

00:20:20.370 --> 00:20:23.120
If the headmaster finds out, you'll be expelled,

00:20:23.120 --> 00:20:25.460
and as prefect I'll be punished, too!

00:20:25.460 --> 00:20:26.640
What a hassle.

00:20:26.640 --> 00:20:28.120
If you don't like it, get out!

00:20:29.330 --> 00:20:34.080
Promise to choose me, and I'll stop 
gambling and even leave the dorm.

00:20:34.470 --> 00:20:35.540
I refuse!

00:20:38.240 --> 00:20:40.510
<i>Does he want to ruin my life?</i>

00:20:40.730 --> 00:20:44.220
<i>I should talk to Kevin and figure 
out how to pay for the next—</i>

00:20:45.990 --> 00:20:47.470
You're late.

00:20:47.700 --> 00:20:48.940
You little brat.

00:20:48.940 --> 00:20:50.810
Don't just stand there. Sit down.

00:20:50.810 --> 00:20:53.580
I must say, these so-called
"biscuits" are quite tasty.

00:20:54.220 --> 00:20:55.440
What do you want?!

00:20:55.440 --> 00:20:56.610
Calm down.

00:20:57.190 --> 00:21:00.730
I don't mind being your patron, 
just as you wished.

00:21:01.370 --> 00:21:03.890
I don't want a damned demon for a patron!

00:21:04.550 --> 00:21:07.480
You'd probably get the money 
through fraud or something.

00:21:07.480 --> 00:21:08.450
No thank you!

00:21:09.310 --> 00:21:11.200
I see, too bad.

00:21:12.380 --> 00:21:16.250
I'm still staying here to keep
an eye on you and Dantalion.

00:21:16.250 --> 00:21:18.500
You're going to live here, too?!

00:21:18.500 --> 00:21:20.060
Don't fret.

00:21:21.150 --> 00:21:26.220
Unlike him, I've a talent for 
fitting in with the masses.

00:21:26.980 --> 00:21:28.180
Oh?

00:21:28.930 --> 00:21:31.170
If you're that intent, have it your way.

00:21:31.170 --> 00:21:35.390
But you're going to have to follow 
the school rules, underclassman.

00:21:35.390 --> 00:21:36.320
What?

00:21:36.320 --> 00:21:37.900
Sytry Cartwright!

00:21:38.170 --> 00:21:41.030
For entering a prefect's
room without permission,

00:21:41.030 --> 00:21:42.860
you are sentenced to clean the floors!

00:21:43.840 --> 00:21:45.070
Drop those hips!

00:21:45.310 --> 00:21:46.810
With more care!

00:21:47.910 --> 00:21:49.310
Don't start slacking!

00:21:49.700 --> 00:21:52.580
Bullying Duke Baalberith's nephew...

00:21:52.860 --> 00:21:55.300
The Elector's not a man to be trifled with.

00:21:57.790 --> 00:22:00.250
William is fearsome.

00:23:40.780 --> 00:23:44.010
I am Dantalion, Grand Duke of Hell.

00:23:44.010 --> 00:23:46.170
Creating illusions is my specialty.

00:23:46.170 --> 00:23:47.820
Hmm? So why don't I ever do it?

00:23:47.820 --> 00:23:49.950
Well, it's too much trouble.

00:23:49.950 --> 00:23:52.340
I have a test tomorrow. Go to bed!

00:23:52.340 --> 00:23:55.060
I can't sleep as long as you're awake!
